            <div xml:id="d1094">

                <pb facs="0962" n="858" sameAs="frus:frus1913/pg858"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 812.00/9676.</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The American Minister to Norway to the Secretary of
                        State.</hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram—Paraphrase.]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">American Legation</hi>, <lb/>
                            <hi rendition="#italic">Christiania</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1913-11-10T14:00:00+01:00">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">Nov. 10, 1913—2 p.m.</hi>
                        </date>
                    </dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>Department’s November 7, 10 p.m. The Minister to Mexico will be instructed to
                    impress upon Huerta the wisdom of retiring.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Schmedeman</hi>.</signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
